{"conversation":"I think my code is kind of slow because it checks every substring and then reverses it to check if it's a palindrome, so that might take a lot of time when the string is long. The time complexity should be something like O(n^3) because of the nested loops and the substring reversal inside. Maybe I need a better way to check for palindromes or to avoid checking all substrings.","python_code":"class Solution:
